        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: બંધારણ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "બંધારણ — bandhāraṇ — \"a constitution\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "આપણું બંધારણ દરેક નાગરિકને સમાન હક આપે છે. āpṇũ bandhāraṇ darek nāgrikne samān hak āpe che. Our constitution gives every citizen equal rights."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A neuter noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "બંધારણ (bandhāraṇ) CDIAL lists Gujarati bandhāraṇ, \"arrangement, construction\", under Sanskrit bandhakaraṇa, \"binding\" (CDIAL 9138); \"a constitution\" is its modern sense, the frame a state is built on."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
